  "outcome_detail": "Accepted by the owner and promoted inside E28b, which adds a 16 GiB KV pool. Against the frozen E27c medians: code decode +10.5% (all three suites above the E27c range), prose +1.2%, C2 +0.2%, C4 -0.3%, C1 end-to-end -2.2%, C1 per-stream TTFT +16.5% (about +56 ms), cached replay -8.2% at 8K and -9.6% at 32K, cold prefill +0.8% to +1.2%. Structured output reaches 7.8 tokens per step. KV capacity 1,278,751 tokens (-4.9%).",
